%% Figure: Queue entry lifecycle (queue.queue_entries.status), both tiers.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WAITING: join (first join creates the session)
    WAITING --> ADMITTED: admission batch (token, 600 s TTL)
    WAITING --> LEFT: customer leaves or releases the place
    ADMITTED --> IN_CHECKOUT: order created (token TTL aligned to hold)
    ADMITTED --> LEFT: customer releases the place (slot refilled)
    ADMITTED --> EXPIRED: token not used in time
    IN_CHECKOUT --> LEFT: paid, failed or cancelled (slot refilled)
    IN_CHECKOUT --> EXPIRED: hold and token expired
    LEFT --> WAITING: rejoin (new position at the back)
    EXPIRED --> WAITING: rejoin (new position at the back)
    LEFT --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
